### 1. Join Queue - Arun
POST http://localhost:8080/api/queue/join?customerName=Arun

### 2. Join Queue - Priya
POST http://localhost:8080/api/queue/join?customerName=Priya

### 3. Join Queue - Karthik
POST http://localhost:8080/api/queue/join?customerName=Karthik


### 4. Check Queue - WAITING
GET http://localhost:8080/api/queue


### 5. Call Arun - CALLED
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/1/call


### 6. Mark Arun as Late - LATE
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/1/late


### 7. Start Service - Priya - SERVING
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/2/start


### 8. Arun Arrives Late
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/1/arrive


### 9. Check Queue After Arun Arrives
GET http://localhost:8080/api/queue


### 10. Complete Priya - COMPLETED
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/2/complete


### 11. Check Queue After Priya Completes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/queue


### Get all queue customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/queue


### Complete customer service
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/9/complete


### Complete Arun's service
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/queue/1/complete

### Check average service time
GET http://localhost:8080/api/queue/average-service-time
